WEBVTT

00:01:27.944 --> 00:01:30.067
And I had to tell them

00:01:30.091 --> 00:01:31.288
we had nothing.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:36.235
We had nothing that could
help them stop this abuse.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:40.837
It took those agents another year

00:01:40.861 --> 00:01:43.862
to ultimately find that child.

00:01:44.853 --> 00:01:47.128
And by the time she was rescued,

00:01:47.152 --> 00:01:53.640
hundreds of images and videos
documenting her rape had gone viral,

00:01:53.664 --> 00:01:55.355
from the dark web

00:01:55.379 --> 00:01:58.396
to peer-to-peer networks,
private chat rooms

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.640
and to the websites you and I use